.TE
.PP
The \f[CR]cmd\f[R] buffer should be at least 32 bytes (the command word
is capped at 31 characters plus NUL).
For \f[CR]arg\f[R], \f[CR]SERVER_MAX_LINE\f[R] (8192) is recommended.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \f[B]0\f[R] on success.
.PP
Returns \f[B]\-1\f[R] if the line is empty or contains only whitespace
(no command word found).
.SH ERRORS
Returns \-1 only when the input line is empty after stripping leading
whitespace.
There is no other error condition.
